=== Momokoi ===

Personal site at [icefla.me](https://icefla.me).

Built with

- [Astro](https://astro.build/)
- Markdown content
- GitHub Pages
- GitHub Actions

## Development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Deploy

Push to the `source` branch. GitHub Actions builds the site and deploys `dist/` to the `master` branch for GitHub Pages.
